assets: 24 referenced, [..], 1 missing (../assets/water-tap.jpg)
onboarding	[..]	v1

$ annotary -p rowan push corpus/release-checklist.md
assets: 3 referenced, [..]
release-checklist	[..]	v1

$ annotary -p rowan push corpus/rfc-tile-cache.md
assets: 2 referenced, [..]
rfc-tile-cache	[..]	v1

