t1	asset ../assets/a.png

$ annotary -p rowan push hist/1/hist-rfc.md
warning: missing asset api-reference.md (not found) — pushed with missing:true
warning: missing asset glossary-multilingual.md (not found) — pushed with missing:true
assets: 2 referenced, [..], 2 missing (api-reference.md, glossary-multilingual.md)
hist-rfc	[..]	v1

$ annotary -p rowan thread new hist-rfc --document -m "The cost table needs a source."
t1	document

$ annotary -p agent thread new hist-rfc "44:27-44:68" -m "Is that still true after the upgrade?"
t2	v1:44:27-44:68 "memory is the most expensive thing we buy"

$ annotary -p rowan thread new hist-rfc "33:64-33:91" -m "Typo."
t3	v1:33:64-33:91 "clients recieve stale tiles"

$ annotary -p rowan thread new hist-rfc "185:54-185:83" -m "Good."
